WEBVTT

00:00:11.473 --> 00:00:12.974
(STRAINING)

00:00:19.147 --> 00:00:22.233
Negative. I've lost sight of the suspect
and am terminating pursuit.
没有发现嫌疑犯 我会暂停追逐行动

00:00:25.278 --> 00:00:27.113
(MIKE CONTINUES SINGING)

00:00:34.204 --> 00:00:35.246
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:00:40.669 --> 00:00:42.963
That pip-squeak really was great.
那个小不点唱得真好

00:00:44.172 --> 00:00:46.049
Thank you. Thank you so much.
谢谢各位

00:00:46.299 --> 00:00:48.218
Oh, please, you're too kind, really.
大家过奖了

00:00:48.301 --> 00:00:49.719
Look at me, I'm turning red.
我都不好意思了

00:00:49.803 --> 00:00:51.513
Stop! I can't take it.
停止！我无法承受了

00:00:51.596 --> 00:00:52.639
Keep it coming.
请继续鼓掌

00:00:53.306 --> 00:00:54.683
Well, I better get back.
我得回去了

00:00:54.766 --> 00:00:56.893
They'll be wondering
what happened to me. (CHUCKLES)
他们会以为我发生什么事了

00:00:57.435 --> 00:00:58.812
You'll visit me though, yeah?
你会来探望我 对吗？

00:00:59.187 --> 00:01:00.480
Yeah, course I will.
当然

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:03.608
See you, son.
再见了 儿子

00:01:11.908 --> 00:01:12.909
(CHUCKLES SOFTLY)

00:01:14.327 --> 00:01:17.789
BUSTER: We have one
final act for you tonight.
我们今晚还有最后一场演出

00:01:17.872 --> 00:01:20.041
Would you please welcome to the stage
请大家欢迎...

00:01:20.166 --> 00:01:22.377
for her first ever live appearance,
今天是她生平第一次的现场演出...

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:23.503
Meena!
米娜！

00:01:23.628 --> 00:01:24.796
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)
米娜！

00:01:26.798 --> 00:01:27.924
Meena?
米娜？

00:01:28.925 --> 00:01:30.260
Is she coming out?
她会上台吗？

00:01:31.511 --> 00:01:33.179
Meena, what's wrong? Are you okay?
米娜 怎么了？你没事吧？

00:01:33.513 --> 00:01:35.432
I... I can't move.
我动不了

00:01:35.515 --> 00:01:38.268
I'm... I'm terrified.
我好害怕

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:40.603
(AUDIENCE CLAPPING RHYTHMICALLY)

00:01:40.895 --> 00:01:42.272
Give me your hand, kid.
把手给我 小孩

00:01:43.064 --> 00:01:44.274
(GRUNTS)

00:01:44.482 --> 00:01:45.525
Okay, deep breaths.
好了 深呼吸

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:48.653
Deep breaths, and remember what I told you.
深呼吸 记住我对你说过的

00:01:48.737 --> 00:01:53.783
You will not feel afraid anymore
if you just start singing.
“你一开始唱歌就不会再害怕”

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:55.035
ALL: Meena!
-米娜！
-米娜！

00:01:55.118 --> 00:01:56.119
Meena!
米娜！

00:01:58.955 --> 00:02:00.749
Oh! Oh, I'm so sorry!
真是抱歉！

00:02:01.082 --> 00:02:02.625
(LAUGHS)

00:02:03.376 --> 00:02:04.669
Uh...

00:02:04.961 --> 00:02:06.046
Okay.
好的

00:02:07.088 --> 00:02:08.757
Uh...

00:02:12.719 --> 00:02:13.970
Sing.
开始唱

00:02:15.263 --> 00:02:16.431
Okay.
好的

00:02:20.518 --> 00:02:25.482
(SINGING SOUL SONG)

00:02:33.406 --> 00:02:34.491
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:02:35.825 --> 00:02:37.243
(MUSIC PLAYING)

00:02:37.327 --> 00:02:40.163
(CONTINUES SINGING)

00:03:11.903 --> 00:03:12.904
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)

00:03:47.689 --> 00:03:48.690
Whoo-hoo!

00:03:54.112 --> 00:03:56.322
Guys, guys, wait. We can talk this over, right?
各位 等等
我们可以好好谈谈 对吗？

00:03:56.406 --> 00:03:58.658
We're all reasonable individuals here.
我们都是讲理的人

00:03:58.741 --> 00:03:59.742
(SCREAMS)

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:01.411
(GRUNTS)

00:04:03.329 --> 00:04:04.497
Get in! Quick!
快上车！

00:04:05.039 --> 00:04:06.249
Oh, thank you, sweetheart!
谢谢你 宝贝！

00:04:06.332 --> 00:04:07.625
-(GROWLS)
-(YELPS)

00:04:07.709 --> 00:04:09.419
-Whew! That was close!
-Yeah.
-那真是惊险！
-是的

00:04:09.586 --> 00:04:10.837
(GROWLS)

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.047
(CONTINUES SINGING)

00:04:28.438 --> 00:04:29.898
(VOCALIZING)

00:04:37.947 --> 00:04:39.199
(LOUD CHEERING)

00:04:43.036 --> 00:04:45.788
(CONTINUES SINGING)

00:04:59.719 --> 00:05:01.095
(VOCALIZING)

00:05:09.896 --> 00:05:10.897
Come on!
来吧！

00:05:11.231 --> 00:05:12.273
(ALL VOCALIZING)

00:05:15.485 --> 00:05:17.403
(CONTINUES SINGING)

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:33.503
(VOCALIZING)

00:05:41.886 --> 00:05:47.392
(CONTINUES SINGING)

00:05:47.558 --> 00:05:49.060
(CHEERING AND APPLAUSE)

00:05:52.814 --> 00:05:54.232
She did it!
-她做到了！
-你做到了！

00:05:54.691 --> 00:05:55.942
Go, go!
去吧！

00:06:05.201 --> 00:06:08.288
Oh, Dad, I wish you could see this.
爸爸 我真希望你能见到这一切

00:07:26.282 --> 00:07:27.658
Everybody ready?
大家准备好了吗？

00:07:28.284 --> 00:07:31.120
All creatures great and small,
各位不管肥瘦高矮的贵宾...

00:07:31.579 --> 00:07:35.875
welcome to the New Moon Theater!
欢迎来到全新的穆恩剧场！

00:07:35.958 --> 00:07:37.085
(CHEERING AND APPLAUSE)
欢迎来到全新的穆恩剧场！

00:07:47.595 --> 00:07:49.680
(FUNK MUSIC PLAYING)

